<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens slightly against dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens slightly against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened slightly against the dollar on Thursday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling traded at a mean rate of 598.9302 compared with 598.9005 on Wednesday and against the pound it traded at a mean rate of 984.3448 from 973.9949 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
